# Pairs with LivePublisherPinned. The leaf's terminal seam retirement runs when no
# terminal step owes it - from a routine deactivation, say - and removes a live
# leaf's pin.
MODULE: LivePublisherPinnedSelfRetireUnowed
TARGET: LivePublisherPinned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the self-retirement runs outside a terminal step
PERTURBS: SelfRetire

--- FIND
SelfRetire(k) ==
    /\ k \in owed
--- REPLACE
SelfRetire(k) ==
\* MUTATION: not owed by a terminal step.
    /\ k \in Keys
--- END
